    "title": "(AMZN-NLN) GameSir T4w USB Wired Game Controller Gamepad with Vibration and Turbo Function Joystick for Windows 7/8/10",
    "body_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>As our store also sell on amazon, we do receive returns from the customers by stating reason as \"No longer needed\" called as AMZN-NLN. The products sold in this collection are UNUSED, in almost new - 100% working condition. So, here is an opportunity for our customers to experience the best at deeply discounted prices :)</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/GameSir_B_W_52b281cc-066c-487f-8f2b-cfcda8adf324.jpg?v=1621824436\" alt=\"Gamesir t4w usb wired game controller gamepad with vibration and turbo function joystick for windows 7/8/10\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_dynamic\"><widget data-widget-type=\"customText\" id=\"25182384\" title=\"\" type=\"custom\"></widget></div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_image\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_image\">\n<img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"//ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H06e384493d3a438392d7d19d5bf3150a1.jpg\" alt=\"Gamesir t4w usb wired game controller gamepad with vibration and turbo function joystick for windows 7/8/10\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"//ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Hf06bfd3e283745da89ffc74f968dab56f.jpg\" alt=\"Gamesir t4w usb wired game controller gamepad with vibration and turbo function joystick for windows 7/8/10\" loading=\"lazy\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_text\">\n<p class=\"detail-desc-decorate-title\" style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 900; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Asymmetric &amp; Vibrating Motors</p>\n<p class=\"detail-desc-decorate-content\" style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 300; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Vibrating motors with 5 speed levels enhances immersion in games, provides real-time and realistic gaming experience.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_image\"><img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"//ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H86fd40fd31f54c08a8a874478583a4efW.jpg\" alt=\"Gamesir t4w usb wired game controller gamepad with vibration and turbo function joystick for windows 7/8/10\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_text\">\n<p class=\"detail-desc-decorate-title\" style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 900; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">GameSir MCU Chip</p>\n<p class=\"detail-desc-decorate-content\" style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 300; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">It ensures faster response and higher performance. Compatible with Windows7/8/10.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_image\"><img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"//ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H5166ebf6a2624fb984f56f1b99950578d.jpg\" alt=\"Gamesir t4w usb wired game controller gamepad with vibration and turbo function joystick for windows 7/8/10\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_text\">\n<p class=\"detail-desc-decorate-title\" style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 900; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Colorful LED Backlight</p>\n<p class=\"detail-desc-decorate-content\" style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 300; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Stunning colorful LED backlight on ABXY buttons and right joystick glows even in the dark.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_image\">\n<img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"//ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H3ded1f59a71e4c3f8eae85034412f0114.jpg\" alt=\"Gamesir t4w usb wired game controller gamepad with vibration and turbo function joystick for windows 7/8/10\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"//ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Hdbf89ed8c39c4f24aeb74c70cbc7d6c4k.jpg\" alt=\"Gamesir t4w usb wired game controller gamepad with vibration and turbo function joystick for windows 7/8/10\" loading=\"lazy\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_text\">\n<p class=\"detail-desc-decorate-title\" style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 900; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Wired Connection</p>\n<p class=\"detail-desc-decorate-content\" style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 300; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">6.56 ft. over-length USB cable provides instant feedback and allows you to play freely in games.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_image\"><img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"//ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Hcaaa68d9480b469a961436fdf852c0fff.jpg\" alt=\"Gamesir t4w usb wired game controller gamepad with vibration and turbo function joystick for windows 7/8/10\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_text\">\n<p class=\"detail-desc-decorate-title\" style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 900; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Pioneering Design</p>\n<p class=\"detail-desc-decorate-content\" style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 300; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Innovative handle with translucent and anti-slip texture.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_image\">\n<img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"//ae01.alicdn.com/kf/He01268ed3ffd4dcca39fd9f54c8f378er.jpg\" alt=\"Gamesir t4w usb wired game controller gamepad with vibration and turbo function joystick for windows 7/8/10\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"//ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Hebcc37fdbb4d465a8bd4f961513b267fn.jpg\" alt=\"Gamesir t4w usb wired game controller gamepad with vibration and turbo function joystick for windows 7/8/10\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"//ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Hcf222e34a15445999634cbce4a2e1d21H.jpg\" alt=\"Gamesir t4w usb wired game controller gamepad with vibration and turbo function joystick for windows 7/8/10\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"//ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H744469466e244dbe8a6ae44c24594741c.jpg\" alt=\"Gamesir t4w usb wired game controller gamepad with vibration and turbo function joystick for windows 7/8/10\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"//ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H842e95fe0e154e3c9d9fbc04393c7c83w.jpg\" alt=\"Gamesir t4w usb wired game controller gamepad with vibration and turbo function joystick for windows 7/8/10\" loading=\"lazy\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_text\">\n<p class=\"detail-desc-decorate-title\" style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 900; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Tech Specs</p>\n<p class=\"detail-desc-decorate-content\" style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 300; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Brand: GameSir Model: T4w Connection: Wired Working Platforms: Windows PC (Windows 7 or later) Vibration Function: Yes Turbo Function: Yes Connectivity: USB Cable Length: 6.56 ft. Package Size: 6.18*5.12*2.80 in. Gross Weight: 0.75 lb.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_text\">\n<p class=\"detail-desc-decorate-title\" style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 900; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\u00a0</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_image\"><img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"//ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H8a61aebd3a5c4c05af1e290893013e2cs.jpg\" alt=\"Gamesir t4w usb wired game controller gamepad with vibration and turbo function joystick for windows 7/8/10\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_dynamic\"><widget data-widget-type=\"customText\" id=\"25069868\" title=\"\" type=\"custom\"></widget></div>",
